  "prefLabel": "Odb 102.03 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address and Telephone Number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 102.03 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address and Telephone Number.\n\n(a) The board’s office location shall be at the:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Environmental Services\n\n29 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, New Hampshire\n\n(b) The board’s office shall be open to the public Monday through Friday, 8:00 am to 4:00 pm, excluding holidays.\n\n(c) Correspondence shall be addressed to the board at:\n\nOil Fund Disbursement Board\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Environmental Services\n\nWaste Management Division\n\nP.O. Box 95\n\nConcord, N.H. 03302-0095\n\n(d) The board’s telephone number shall be (603) 271-3899.\n\nSource. #8456, eff 10-25-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
